  clueName: "Nathan\u2019s journal page"
  clueDescription: "\u201CIt\u2019s not a ruin. It\u2019s a door. I didn\u2019t understand
    before. We took without paying. They sent fish, and we forgot our debt. But something
    remembers. And I think it\u2019s waiting for me.\u201D\n_________________________________________________________________"
